# gtr-low-chords: power chords on the three lowest strings of a 7-string in drop A (A1 E2 A2 open), at the open
# position, 3rd, 5th and 7th frets: each strummed once and left ringing, then the same four chugged palm-muted (there
# one of the chord's notes must sound, any of them may).
